                    },
                    "chapter": 4,
                    "text": "苏天晴踱步走到风信子身后，月光映出她脸上的坏笑。"
                  },
                  {
                    "span": {
                      "sourceId": "source-c04",
                      "sourceRevision": 1,
                      "paragraph": 126,
                      "start": 0,
                      "end": 17
                    },
                    "chapter": 4,
                    "text": "然后捏起一根狗尾巴草，轻笑着说道："
                  },
                  {
                    "span": {
                      "sourceId": "source-c04",
                      "sourceRevision": 1,
                      "paragraph": 127,
                      "start": 0,
                      "end": 7
                    },
                    "chapter": 4,
                    "text": "“挠痒痒哟。”"
                  },
                  {
                    "span": {
                      "sourceId": "source-c04",
                      "sourceRevision": 1,
                      "paragraph": 128,
                      "start": 0,
                      "end": 34
                    },
                    "chapter": 4,
                    "text": "“这样吧，要是风信子小姐你能坚持一分钟不叫出声，狐狐我就放你下来~”"
                  }
                ]
